		(uuid "9e5c2370-fb21-4ed1-a888-7327f3085ce9")
	)
	(text "DANGER: 120 VAC. Maintain reinforced creepage/clearance, isolation slots and a primary keepout around J20/F20/RV20/PS20. PE/CHASSIS is not DC GND."
